    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976731266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 31729,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976735866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976737866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's VF886-012.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 31729,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976743133332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... Okay, I see your order for the VeloFit Carbon Road cycling shoes, delivered 17 days ago. Can I ask what the problem was?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976744733332
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't fit right. I went on one ride and they gave me awful blisters. The cleats never felt secure either.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 31729,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976754599998
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. Comfort is key. Let me just pull up our policy for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976762133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 31729,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976767933331
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I've checked here and you are well within the 90-day return window. I can definitely process a return for a full refund for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976768633331
    },
    {
