      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 31729,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764976777766664
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. I've just emailed a prepaid return label to the address on file. Just box up the shoes and drop them off with the carrier. Once our warehouse receives them, your refund will be processed back to your original payment method within 5-7 business days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
